# Mercedes-Benz C-Class W204 (C200) four-door saloon, 2007-2014.
#
# The W204 C-Class: 4,586 mm long, 1,770 mm wide, 1,447 mm high, 2,760 mm
# wheelbase; 1.6-3.0 petrol and 2.0/3.0 diesel, the C200 Kompressor and C220 CDI
# the volume models in Britain. Facelift in 2011.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercedes-Benz_C-Class_(W204)
#
# Colours: Obsidian Black, Iridium Silver, Tenorite Grey and Palladium Silver are
# period Mercedes-Benz finishes.
#
# Weight: 180 in total (black 65, silver 55, grey 35, blue 25).
#
# Speed 240 km/h; comfort 130/525 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 2007-2014 with a road tail to about 2026.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/mercedes-w204.blend. References:
# citycars/references/mercedes-w204/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

